ZMod.mod_four_ne_three_of_sq_eq_neg_one {p : ℕ} [Fact (Nat.Prime p)] {y : ZMod p} (hy : y ^ 2 = -1) : p % 4 ≠ 3
ZMod.exists_sq_eq_neg_one_iff {p : ℕ} [Fact (Nat.Prime p)] : IsSquare (-1) ↔ p % 4 ≠ 3
'ZMod.mod_four_ne_three_of_sq_eq_neg_one' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
